This directory contains third-party code vendored from the mcp-for-blender
project (formerly blender-mcp):

    https://github.com/ahujasid/blender-mcp
    SPDX-License-Identifier: MIT
    Copyright (c) 2025 Siddharth Ahuja

Scope of vendoring:

  - Unmodified upstream modules (as bundled in brickfly_mcp 2.0.0, which
    itself ships mcp-for-blender 2.0.0 verbatim):
        safe_mode.py, trajectory.py, telemetry.py, telemetry_decorator.py,
        consent_prompt.py, config.py

  - Modified downstream (GN tool bindings added by THIS project on top of
    the upstream/fork code: 8 tools - gn_compile, gn_verify, gn_checkpoint,
    gn_revert, gn_render_diff, gn_ab_prepare, gn_ab_commit, gn_export_state):
        server.py, addon_manager.py, bundled/addon.py, __init__.py,
        bundled/__init__.py

The original MIT license text is reproduced below, as required by the
license for all copies or substantial portions of the Software.

